@host = http://localhost:5119
@apiKey = gh_agent_key_0001

### Vector Search Test — "my VPN keeps timing out"
# Should return the VPN troubleshooting article at the top,
# even though the exact phrasing doesn't match the stored article.
GET {{host}}/api/knowledge/search-test?q=my VPN keeps timing out
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Vector Search Test — "can't get email on my phone"
# Should return the email sync article, demonstrating that vector search
# finds meaning, not keywords. The vocabulary is entirely different from the article.
GET {{host}}/api/knowledge/search-test?q=can't get email on my phone
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Chat (non-streaming) — Verify chat still works after vector store changes
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "My VPN keeps timing out after MFA approval. What should I check first?"
}

### Chat (streaming SSE) — Verify streaming still works
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "How do I reset my password at Globomatics?"
}

### Chat — Show the model has NO knowledge base access yet
# The model will give generic advice, not Globomatics-specific procedures.
# After Demo 3, this same question will return grounded answers.
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "What is the process for requesting a new laptop?"
}
